### OpenAI · https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=

### Optional chat model override (defaults to gpt-4o-mini)
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

### Google Maps Platform · either env name accepts the same key
### GCP: Billing on → enable Places API (New) + Geocoding API → restrict key.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

### Supabase · outreach history + duplicate email prevention
### Project URL from Supabase → Settings → API
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
### Service role key (server-only — never expose in client bundles publicly)
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
